{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1563","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"一 诵读和欣赏本单元所选的诗词名作，结合已经学过的古诗词，联系当代文化生活中有关古诗词诵读的现象，想一想：在现代忙碌的生活中，古诗词究竟是必需品还是调味品？在当今社会生活中，你能看到哪些古诗词的“渗透”？你感觉古诗词的学习到底对自己的语文素养提升有哪些帮助？……围绕这些问题，以“今天，我们为什么读古诗词”为主题，举办一次班级研讨会。结合学习古诗词的心得，提炼观点，推选代表在会上发言。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"为师按：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"全世界都在做加法，我们试试减法。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"不谈诗词好不好，我们一起写写小作文：如果，我们没了所有的古诗词。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"runs":[{"text":"二 中国的古典诗歌以抒情诗为主，也有一些侧重叙事的诗作，如《氓》和《孔雀东南飞》。这两首诗都是讲述古代婚姻爱情悲剧的民歌。试分别梳理它们的情节，从人物形象、语言风格、表现手法等方面比较两首诗作的异同。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"三 借助想象，置身诗境，通过对意象的揣摩和对意境的体察，把握诗歌的主旨，是鉴赏古典诗歌的重要方法。从以下两项任务中任选一项完成。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"古典诗词多以虚实相生的手法营造艺术境界，如《蜀道难》写实与想象交织，写出蜀道之“难”，形成迷离惝恍、奇丽峭拔的诗歌境界。从本单元中另外选取一首诗歌，探究诗人是如何运用虚实相生的艺术手法的。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"阅读古典诗词，要把握作品中意象的特点，揣摩其组合方式，体会独特的意境。反复诵读品味《望海潮》（东南形胜）和《扬州慢》（淮左名都）两首词，比较二者在意象选取和意境营造上的不同。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"ordered":true,"type":"list"},{"runs":[{"text":"四 选择本单元所学的一首诗歌，或拓展阅读下面所列古代诗词，写一篇不少于800 字的鉴赏文章。可从语言、构思、意象、情感等方面选择一两个角度，发现作者独特的艺术创造，分析自己阅读欣赏获得的审美体验。在此基础上，全班合作，编一本《古典诗词鉴赏集》。可以按不同的方式编排，如体式、题材、时代、风格流派等。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"①温庭筠《菩萨蛮》（小山重叠金明灭）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"②周邦彦《苏幕遮》（燎沉香）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"③辛弃疾《青玉案·元夕》","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"④刘克庄《贺新郎》（国脉微如缕）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"⑤王实甫《长亭送别》（【正宫】【端正好】）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83%e7%a0%94%e4%b9%a0%e4%bb%bb%e5%8a%a1","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83%e7%a0%94%e4%b9%a0%e4%bb%bb%e5%8a%a1","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83%e7%a0%94%e4%b9%a0%e4%bb%bb%e5%8a%a1","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10449,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83%e7%a0%94%e4%b9%a0%e4%bb%bb%e5%8a%a1","postId":10449,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83%e7%a0%94%e4%b9%a0%e4%bb%bb%e5%8a%a1","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83%e7%a0%94%e4%b9%a0%e4%bb%bb%e5%8a%a1","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-10452-h-1","postId":10452,"postNumber":4,"postRole":"discussion","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-10452-h-1","text":"#p-10452-h-1","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-10454-h-1","postId":10454,"postNumber":6,"postRole":"discussion","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-10454-h-1","text":"#p-10454-h-1","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/bW7x8CZC0A1ZhSr255U7RcHTsII.pdf","postId":45883,"postNumber":8,"postRole":"discussion","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/uploads/short-url/bW7x8CZC0A1ZhSr255U